<p>Reach inside your dwarven core and summon your stone and crystaline halves to fight alongside you for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6, 7, 8, 9, 10</acronym> turns.</p><p>Your Crystaline Half will attack your foes with earthen missiles.</p><p>Your Stone Half will taunt your foes to protect you.</p><p>This power can not be called upon while under the effect of Deeprock Form.</p><p></p>